s://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0a/jlsh7i3oagmdv0x0dsdy7whg6g3ip8s.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E6%B6%8C%E5%8A%A8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0a/jlsh7i3oagmdv0x0dsdy7whg6g3ip8s.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />元素涌动\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]地块和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地块及其效果。<br />✦自身受到治疗效果降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>，获得的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>，拥有护盾时，免疫打断效果。<br />✦魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">5%</font>。触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰火律动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰火律动</font></span></span>]时，伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\"