0%</font>，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>点能量，所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">职业技能</span>]冷却回合减<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>。<br />✦主动攻击后，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰火易伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰火易伤</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动结束时，若处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形格，则获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>魔攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔法护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">魔法护盾</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163450\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.328 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.453 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5635/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70322/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18954/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  408.130      1 模板:个性\n100.00%  408.130      1 -total\n 63.57%  259.465      5 模板:中括号介绍化\n 60.32%  246.170     34 模板:中括号介绍\n  2.03%    8.271      1 模板:面包屑\n  1.18%    4.830      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:6718-0